ance'\n | The undefined value. | NULL\n | An unsigned 32-bit integer. | 4294967295\n | A pseudo-type that combines an with a . | 148591304110702593\n | A string of Unicode characters. | 'a1b2c3'\n | TIME stores a time of day in UTC. TIMETZ converts TIME values with a specified time zone offset from UTC. | TIME '01:23:45.123456' TIMETZ '01:23:45.123456-5:00'\n | TIMESTAMP stores a date and time pairing in UTC.TIMESTAMPTZ converts TIMESTAMP values with a specified time zone offset from UTC. | TIMESTAMP '2016-01-25 10:10:10'TIMESTAMPTZ '2016-01-25 10:10:10-05:00'\n | A list of lexemes and operators used in . | 'list' & 'lexem' & 'oper' & 'use' & 'full' & 'text' & 'search'\n | A list of lexemes with optional integer positions and weights used in . | 'full':13 'integ':7 'lexem':4 'list':2 'option':6 'posit':8 'search':15 'text':14 'use':11 'weight':10\n | A 128-bit hexadecimal value. | 7f9c24e8-3b12-4fef-91e0-56a2d5a246ec\n | A fixed-length array of floating-point numbers. | [1.0, 0.0, 0.0]", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "table", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "table_headers": ["Type", "Description", "Example"], "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0002_b0002", "order": 2, "role": "table_candidate", "language": ""}, {"block_type": "table_row", "text": "Type | Description | Example", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "tr", "anchor": null, "table_headers": ["Type", "Description", "Example"], "cells": ["Type", "Description", "Example"], "link_targets": [], "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0002_b0003", "order": 3, "role": "table_candidate", "language": ""}, {"block_type": "table_row", "text": " | A 1-dimensional, 1-indexed, homogeneous array of any non-array data type. | {\"sky\",\"road\",\"car\"}", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "tr", "anchor": null, "table_headers": ["Type", "Description", "