{"section_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003", "page_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types", "url": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "section_source": "heading_tree", "section_kind": "heading_section", "heading": "​Data type conversions and casts", "heading_path": ["​Data type conversions and casts"], "anchor": "data-type-conversions-and-casts", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types#data-type-conversions-and-casts", "section_hash": "84a4536d7a1dd4f8dd0e6caa1bb0ad4d17c7888650cf9fbd556195c47744de0f", "blocks": [{"block_type": "heading", "text": "​Data type conversions and casts", "level": 2, "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types#data-type-conversions-and-casts", "html_tag": "h2", "anchor": "data-type-conversions-and-casts", "anchor_kind": "element_anchor", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0001", "order": 1, "role": "heading", "language": ""}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "<type 'string literal'", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0002", "order": 2, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "DATE '2008-12-21'", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0003", "order": 3, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "INT '123'", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0004", "order": 4, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "BOOL 'true'", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0005", "order": 5, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "list", "text": "<type 'string literal', to convert from the literal representation of a value to a value of that type. For example: DATE '2008-12-21', INT '123', or BOOL 'true'.", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "li", "anchor": null, "link_targets": [], "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0006", "order": 6, "role": "metadata", "language": ""}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "<value::<data type", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0007", "order": 7, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "signature", "text": "CAST(<value AS <data type>)", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0008", "order": 8, "role": "syntax_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "NOW()::DECIMAL", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0009", "order": 9, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "VARIANCE(a+2)::INT", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0010", "order": 10, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "list", "text": "<value::<data type, or its equivalent longer form CAST(<value AS <data type>), which converts an arbitrary expression of one built-in type to another (this is also known as type coercion or “casting”). For example: NOW()::DECIMAL, VARIANCE(a+2)::INT.", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "li", "anchor": null, "link_targets": [], "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0011", "order": 11, "role": "metadata", "language": ""}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "To create constant values, consider using a type annotation instead of a cast, as it provides more predictable results.", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "div", "anchor": null, "language": "sql", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0012", "order": 12, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "signature", "text": "from_ip()", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0013", "order": 13, "role": "syntax_candidate"}, {"block_type": "signature", "text": "to_ip()", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0014", "order": 14, "role": "syntax_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "STRING", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0015", "order": 15, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "code", "text": "BYTES", "source_anchor": "https://www.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/data-types", "html_tag": "code", "anchor": null, "anchor_kind": null, "language": "", "block_id": "cockroachdb_stable_data_types_s0003_b0016", "order": 16, "role": "example_candidate"}, {"block_type": "list", "text": "Other when the type is not a SQL type, for example from_ip(), to_ip() to convert IP addresses between STRING and BYTES values.", "sourc